{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act36side_level_act36side_06_end",
  "groupId": "act36side",
  "stageId": "act36side_06",
  "title": "海鮮拼盤",
  "storyCode": "DT-6",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act36side/level_act36side_06_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "38590704d00094189356cc6d1754dd447a4a8628b6fd194a31a30464dc44e667",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "哦？這個聲音……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "我以為他們會更加謹慎一些……沒想到，他們自信到如此地步？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "呵呵，無論如何，結果是一樣的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "教會正是需要人手的時候。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "成為我們的一員吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "然後，讓我們共同為伊比利亞人帶去啟示。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "陷阱大概就這樣吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "剩下就等他們打夠食材跑出來了，應該足夠幫他們抵擋一下子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "唉，萊歐斯這傢伙，有些時候還是蠻細膩的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "箱子",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "這裡怎麼會有個箱子？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "……難道說，在這個世界也有寶箱怪？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "箱子",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "呃，這傢伙也太不專業了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "在沙灘這麼空無一物的地方，真的能騙到人嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "咦……？有腳步聲……我猜，是那個神秘奇怪的傢伙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "他們終會變成我們的兄弟手足，很快，很快，他們會變得更好……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "嘁，這傢伙……果然想讓我們去送死嗎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "……有了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "等審判庭的人來了，剛好拿他們試一試。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "試什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "你……你怎麼沒有進去？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "我本來就沒什麼戰鬥能力，所以在等他們出來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "……是嗎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "你剛才提到審判庭，那是什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "……那是我們共同的敵人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "可以說給我聽聽嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "（這個杜林看起來的確沒什麼戰鬥力……和他聊聊也沒什麼。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "（就他這身板，他還能跑到哪裡去呢？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "當然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "這裡好像會被人看到……我們去那邊那個箱子上聊吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "好的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "箱子？",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "那麼，我們就從審判庭對伊比利亞的欺瞞開始——咦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "（猛地打開）（吞食）（關閉）（歡快地晃動）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "……嘴上說著兄弟，結果你對這些魔物也不怎麼瞭解嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "在我們這一行，這樣是會吃虧的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "呼，總算全都幹掉了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "本來以為會有很多……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "那隻像克拉肯的魔物死了之後，想必大部分也都逃走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "殺死牠的人比我們有口福呢……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "先西，你怎麼看，這些魔物能吃嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "堅決不吃！看上去也太噁心了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "在老夫看來，只要用心對待並妥善處理，這些魔物可以變成健康又美味的一餐！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "可是這裡距離那座城市並不遠，也不算很隱蔽，沒理由一直沒被人發現吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "那裡的人都不吃，不就是說明這些東西不能吃嗎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "我看那個神神秘秘的教士就是想騙我們來送死！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "未必。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "這裡棲息著的毫無疑問是魔物……我們在那座城市裡並沒有見到有武裝的人，他們可能也是有心無力。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "海鮮是很好的蛋白質來源，如果能夠用牠們好好做一頓飯，肯定能讓他們飽餐一頓。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "不行不行不行！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "老夫覺得沒有什麼不妥。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "老夫雖然沒有真正料理過克拉肯，但魚貝蝦章魚都是處理過的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "提醒你一下，除了這些，我們能吃的就只有從海裡衝上來的魚和貝殼了喔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "……我知道了啦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "這隻的透明腦袋裡面是……黏黏的的液體？包裹著內臟和黃……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "內臟一定是不能吃的，剩下的黃和液體倒出來看看……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "很像雞蛋啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "等一下放進碗裡打散看看……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "我也覺得就是雞蛋的感覺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "我們不是還在清理魔物嗎，能不能請你們不要直接就開始研究要怎麼吃了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "話不能這麼說，這也是研究魔物的最好手段。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "瑪露希爾，你有沒有發現，這種海葵像一樣的魔物，你已經幫我們料理好了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "……還真的是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "但是被爆炸烤過以後，感覺已經有點燒焦了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "還有這些奇怪的海草，被烤乾之後都脫落下來了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "應該都不能吃了吧？要不然別吃了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "在老夫看來火候剛剛好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "不再有魔物從洞窟深處湧來了，看來，牠們畏懼了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "嗯，從魔物屍體的數量來看，也差不多夠做一頓大餐了，我們走吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "咦……奇爾查克，你身邊怎麼有一隻箱子……？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "而且，這個昏倒的人……是那個教士？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "哼，這教士想騙我們來這裡送死，我稍微用這傢伙懲罰了一下他。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "欸？這教士是騙人的？但我們的確打到了好多好多海鮮啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "而且你說……“這傢伙”？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "唉，我就知道，就是牠，這個世界也有寶箱怪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "箱子？",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "（猛地打開）（被奇爾查克控制住）（吃不到）（憤怒地抖動）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "……奇爾查克，你好熟練啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "是這傢伙的偽裝太爛了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "反正你一定是打算吃看看這個世界的寶箱怪的味道吧，給你了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "哇，真的嗎，奇爾查克，你真是個好人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "（小聲）這算是在體諒他嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "（小聲）……算是吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "（小聲）奇爾查克，你人真好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "（小聲）閉嘴！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "走吧，我們去海灘上生火！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "先從這種海葵一樣的魔物開始吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "剛才我就在想了……應該是在這個地方……嗯，在這裡！看來牠的頭部是在下面。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "嗯？上面這朵花一樣的器官不是牠的頭嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "拆下來看一下。頭部看起來像是海星……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "剝開看看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "喔，果然裡面有黃！每一片“花瓣”上都有。看來現在是牠的繁殖期呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "你這樣一講我更不想吃了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "……我不會再生吃水棲生物了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "早就說過，不經過處理就去生吃未知生物，一定會吃壞肚子啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "好好處理過的正常的生醃和刺身都是很美味的。你自己好好反省吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "那瑪露希爾，正常的生食怎麼做？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "哇！搬起石頭砸自己的腳！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "說嘛說嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "…………",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "醬油裡放上芥末和檸檬、洋蔥、香菜、蒜蓉，有魚露的話也可以加一點，把生的海鮮放進去拌勻醃製。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "……就是這樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "好！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "……但我們沒有醬油也沒有芥末。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "有這個。老夫剛剛在溶洞的角落發現了半箱……“緊急理智萃取液”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "上面寫著“含有少量芥末提取物”，可能是某種調味料吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "……“羅德島生產”？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "是我們要找的那個地方的商品。能在這裡發現這個東西，說不定我們已經離目的地很近了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "既然如此，那剛好就用它來為生食增添一些風味吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "只需要把這些配菜切成合適的大小，倒進容器裡，加入“緊急理智萃取液”，再把包裡最後一點洋蔥和蒜蓉放進去，然後倒入生食拌勻……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "吃一口看看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "好吃！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "至於剩下的這些食材……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "讓老夫看看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "被烤過的海草一大把。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "跟雞蛋一樣的魔物十幾隻。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "十幾隻海葵型魔物。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "還有一隻寶箱怪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "嗯，非常足夠了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "差不多就是這樣吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "一口氣做了這麼多，也還剩下好多食材，應該夠城裡那些人吃了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "好香的味道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "嗯……雖然是用魔物做的，但是這些料理看上去好像還不錯的樣子？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "你們真的有打算分給城裡人嗎？我感覺你們已經要先開動了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "但是，城裡的人聽不懂我們說話……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "我有個辦法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "我們先在海岸上吃，把在沙灘邊遊蕩的人吸引過來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "他們顯然還是有知覺的，等他們吃飽了，再讓他們去分給城裡的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "……根本就是你想先吃的藉口吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "嗯，這裡的人可能也沒見過類似的食物，我們也得親自示範，這些是能吃的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "那就開動吧，各位。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我還要海藻酒！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "哎呀，真是個貪嘴的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "因為很好喝啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "你喜歡就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "希望歌手下次來的時候也能喜歡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民",
      "text": "那幾個外人在海邊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "咦？他們在海邊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "他們在做什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民",
      "text": "在做飯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "做飯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民",
      "text": "用海裡的怪物。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "什麼？！得快去阻止他們！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民",
      "text": "晚了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "這個生醃的味道好刺激。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "但是口感很不錯，很新鮮。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "這個世界的寶箱怪味道也不錯……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "親族……大群……什麼味道，好香……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "啊。那個騙人的教士醒了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "太香了……嗯？！你們在幹嘛？你們、你們煮的是什麼東西？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "教士先生，你告訴我們的洞窟裡，真的有好多海鮮啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "這下子連城鎮裡的人們都不用再挨餓了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "來吃看看嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "你、你們……這是何等的褻瀆！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教士",
      "text": "兄、兄弟手足，我絕不允許——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "完蛋了，教士先生又昏過去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "是餓昏了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "有了！我們可以去海裡撈一點剛才的奇怪海草，用被雷劈的感覺來把教士喚醒！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "都說了他是江湖騙子了，你還這麼關心他！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "奇爾查克，不管怎麼說，這頓海鮮大餐還是拜他所賜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "憑著感恩之心，我們總該做點什麼意思一下吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "……真搞不懂你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "各位，趁著篝火還在，跟我到海邊撈海草吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克&瑪露希爾",
      "text": "喂，你其實只是沒吃飽吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "嗚哇，海水好冷……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "安妮塔終於趕到了海邊，但一切似乎都已經遲了。\n沉寂已久的海灘上，人們久違地聚集了起來。\n遙遠海邊的四人挽起褲腿，似乎是興致勃勃地走入大海，時不時地發出嘻嘻哈哈的聲音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "哇！這裡有小傢伙會啃我的腳趾！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "text": "啊？那、那我們剛剛吃的那些是不是也……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "text": "這是很正常的事，瑪露希爾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "text": "……我好像聽到後面有人在叫……？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "有嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "text": "哇，那邊還有一團會發光的！我要去看看了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民",
      "text": "啊啊、啊啊啊！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民",
      "text": "他們、他他他們……！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民",
      "text": "嗚哇——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "望向眼前的一切，安妮塔總覺得……\n今天吹向鹽風城的海風似乎是迷了她的眼，她看到了些……這輩子都沒想過居然會發生的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
